ollendes Rad"},"why":{"ru":"Дитя вводит движение, исходящее из себя.","en":"The child introduces movement from itself."},"status":"text","speaker":"zarathustra","voices":[{"from":0,"to":25,"speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":null,"mode":"speech","layer":"primary"}],"rank":2}],"thesis":{"ru":"Колесо даёт движению два связанных образа: исходящее из себя начало творца и вечный ход, в котором вещи возвращаются.","en":"The wheel gives motion two related images: the creator’s beginning from itself and the eternal course in which things return.","cite":[{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-78b5795aca827182f53ba266a3271646","tos.text-unit.sid-78b5795aca827182f53ba266a3271646"]},{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.18","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2da48033a6c7d1b2822ac0173af7f7a4","tos.text-unit.sid-2da48033a6c7d1b2822ac0173af7f7a4"]},{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c7a842d1445462c0d0df8eafd83efd39","tos.text-unit.sid-c7a842d1445462c0d0df8eafd83efd39"]}],"status":"reconstruction"},"question":{"ru":"Как мыслить движение, которое начинается из себя и вновь приходит к себе?","en":"How can one think motion that begins from itself and comes back to itself?"},"answer":{"ru":"Дитя названо первым движением и катящимся из себя колесом; в речи зверей колесо бытия катится в ходе смерти, цветения и возвращения.","en":"The child is named a first movement and self-rolling wheel; in the animals’ speech being’s wheel rolls through death, flowering and return.","cite":[{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-78b5795aca827182f53ba266a3271646","tos.text-unit.sid-78b5795aca827182f53ba266a3271646"]},{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c7a842d1445462c0d0df8eafd83efd39","tos.text-unit.sid-c7a842d1445462c0d0df8eafd83efd39"]}],"status":"text"},"grounds":[{"ru":"Создателю задан вопрос, является ли он новой силой и первым движением.","en":"The creator is asked whether they are a new force and first movement.","cite":[{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.18","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2da48033a6c7d1b2822ac0173af7f7a4","tos.text-unit.sid-2da48033a6c7d1b2822ac0173af7f7a4"]}],"status":"text","id":"wheel:essence:grounds:01"}],"consequences":[{"ru":"Рождение высшего тела поручено как создание созидателя.","en":"Giving birth to a higher body is assigned as creating a creator.","cite":[{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e98b4c403feddecdf7b8c80e32ccdced","tos.text-unit.sid-e98b4c403feddecdf7b8c80e32ccdced"]}],"status":"text","id":"wheel:essence:consequences:01"}],"function":{"ru":"Повтор образа соединяет превращения духа, путь творца и родительство; колесо бытия переносит вопрос движения на весь мир.","en":"The repeated image joins the spirit’s metamorphoses, the creator’s path and parenthood; being’s wheel extends motion’s question to the whole world.","cite":[{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-78b5795aca827182f53ba266a3271646","tos.text-unit.sid-78b5795aca827182f53ba266a3271646"]},{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.18","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2da48033a6c7d1b2822ac0173af7f7a4","tos.text-unit.sid-2da48033a6c7d1b2822ac0173af7f7a4"]},{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e98b4c403feddecdf7b8c80e32ccdced","tos.text-unit.sid-e98b4c403feddecdf7b8c80e32ccdced"]},{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c7a842d1445462c0d0df8eafd83efd39","tos.text-unit.sid-c7a842d1445462c0d0df8eafd83efd39"]}],"status":"reconstruction"}},"counter_voices":[{"speaker":"zarathustra","cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3a60e76f8f2922ea9377927d008c2630","tos.text-unit.sid-3a60e76f8f2922ea9377927d008c2630"],"q":"das Rad dieses Wahns"},"line":{"ru":"Заратустра называет круг старой веры в добро и зло колесом заблуждения.","en":"Zarathustra calls the circuit of old belief in good and evil a wheel of delusion."},"status":"text","reply":{"ru":"Он требует исследовать прежние гадания о судьбе и свободе и позднее поручает учиться творчеству.","en":"He calls for examining past guesses about fate and freedom and later assigns learning to create.","cite":[{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-47c1eb4b90ead080cd3289e00e45c2da","tos.text-unit.sid-a17c12f081f8b0e8d28f41ecdc6d1868"]},{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e06512fbe32eb4d894af85db50bf3454","tos.text-unit.sid-e06512fbe32eb4d894af85db50bf3454"]}],"status":"text"}}],"development":{"emergence":{"ru":"Первое колесо даёт имя дитяти как началу.","en":"The first wheel names the child as beginning.","cite":[{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-78b5795aca827182f53ba266a3271646","tos.text-unit.sid-78b5795aca827182f53ba266a3271646"]}],"status":"text"},"movement":[{"ru":"Тот же образ проверяет силу творца и цель рождения ребёнка.","en":"The same image tests the creator’s power and the aim of giving birth.","cite":[{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.18","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2da48033a6c7d1b2822ac0173af7f7a4","tos.text-unit.sid-2da48033a6c7d1b2822ac0173af7f7a4"]},{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e98b4c403feddecdf7b8c80e32ccdced","tos.text-unit.sid-e98b4c403feddecdf7b8c80e32ccdced"]}],"status":"text"}],"transformation":{"ru":"Звери называют колесом вечный ход бытия.","en":"The animals call being’s eternal course a wheel.","cite":[{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c7a842d1445462c0d0df8eafd83efd39","tos.text-unit.sid-c7a842d1445462c0d0df8eafd83efd39"]}],"status":"text"}},"dimensions":[{"name":{"ru":"Первое движение","en":"First movement"},"lens":"existence","ru":"Свобода творца проверяется образом колеса, движущегося из себя.","en":"The creator’s freedom is tested by the self-moving wheel.","cite":[{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.18","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2da48033a6c7d1b2822ac0173af7f7a4","tos.